    "closest_pair": "For every polygon pair within one family, approximate nearest coastline via vertex-to-edge Euclidean distance, then derive a minimum spanning tree. Each family has member_count-1 links.",
    "units": "local planar 2400x1200 SVG working coordinates; absolutely not km, ocean width, travel distance or physical geological age",
    "caveats": [
      "Some link segments may cross other features or water regions; they are pairing indicators, not sea routes.",
